      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{选用随机变量} &amp; F=\\frac{s_{A}^{2}}{\\sigma_{A}^{2}}/\\frac{s_{B}^{2}}{\\sigma_{B}^{2}}\\sim F(n_{1}-1,n_{2}-1),\\\\&amp;\\text{依题意，已知}s_{i}^{2}=0.5419,\\ s_{n}^{2}=0.6065,\\ n_{1}=n_{2}=10.\\\\&amp;\\text{对于}1-\\alpha=0.95,\\ \\text{查}F\\text{分布表得}F_{0.025}(9,9)=\\frac{1}{4.03}=\\frac{1}{4.03},\\ \\text{于是得}\\frac{\\sigma_{A}^{2}}{\\sigma_{B}^{2}}\\text{的0.95的置信区间为}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\left(\\frac{s_{A}^{2}}{s_{B}^{2}}\\frac{1}{F_{w_{2}}(9,9)},\\frac{s_{A}^{2}}{s_{B}^{2}}\\frac{F_{w_{2}}(9,9)}{4.03}\\right)\\approx(0.222,3.601).\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{选用随机变量} &amp; F=\\frac{s_{A}^{2}}{\\sigma_{A}^{2}}/\\frac{s_{B}^{2}}{\\sigma_{B}^{2}}\\sim F(n_{1}-1,n_{2}-1),\\\\&amp;\\text{依题意，已知}s_{i}^{2}=0.5419,\\ s_{n}^{2}=0.6065,\\ n_{1}=n_{2}=10.\\\\&amp;\\text{对于}1-\\alpha=0.95,\\ \\text{查}F\\text{分布表得}F_{0.025}(9,9)=\\frac{1}{4.03}=\\frac{1}{4.03},\\ \\text{于是得}\\frac{\\sigma_{A}^{2}}{\\sigma_{B}^{2}}\\text{的0.95的置信区间为}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\left(\\frac{s_{A}^{2}}{s_{B}^{2}}\\frac{1}{F_{w_{2}}(9,9)},\\frac{s_{A}^{2}}{s_{B}^{2}}\\frac{F_{w_{2}}(9,9)}{4.03}\\right)\\approx(0.222,3.601).\\end{aligned}</div>"
