      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由所给数据算出}\\quad\\overline{x_1}=98.40,\\ \\overline{x_2}=110.71,\\ s_1^2=8.73^3,\\ s_2^2=32.19^2,\\ n_1=5,\\ n_2=7.\\\\&amp;\\text{因为是求方差比的区间估计，故选用F分布变量，即}\\quad F=\\frac{S_1^2}{S_2^2}\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{\\sigma_2^2}\\sim F(n_1-1,\\,n_2-1).\\\\&amp;\\text{对于置信度}1-\\alpha,\\text{取双侧概率相等的置信区间为}\\quad\\left(\\frac{S_1^2}{S_2^2},\\frac{1}{F_{\\alpha/2}(n_1-1,\\,n_2-1)},\\frac{S_1^2}{S_2^2}F_{\\alpha/2}(n_2-1,\\,n_1-1)\\right).\\\\&amp;\\text{本题所给}1-\\alpha=0.90,\\ \\alpha=0.10,\\ \\frac{\\alpha}{2}=0.05,\\,n_1=5,\\,n_2=7.\\\\&amp;\\text{查}F\\text{分布表得}\\quad F_{0.05}(6,\\,4)=6.16,\\ F_{0.05}(4,\\,6)=4.53,\\ \\frac{s_1^2}{s_2^2}=\\frac{8,\\,73^2}{32.19^2}=0.0376,\\\\&amp;\\text{于是}\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{\\sigma_2^2}\\text{的}0.90\\text{的置信区间为}\\left(0.073\\times\\frac{1}{4.53},\\,0.0736\\times6.16\\right),\\text{即}(0.016,\\,0.453).\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由所给数据算出}\\quad\\overline{x_1}=98.40,\\ \\overline{x_2}=110.71,\\ s_1^2=8.73^3,\\ s_2^2=32.19^2,\\ n_1=5,\\ n_2=7.\\\\&amp;\\text{因为是求方差比的区间估计，故选用F分布变量，即}\\quad F=\\frac{S_1^2}{S_2^2}\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{\\sigma_2^2}\\sim F(n_1-1,\\,n_2-1).\\\\&amp;\\text{对于置信度}1-\\alpha,\\text{取双侧概率相等的置信区间为}\\quad\\left(\\frac{S_1^2}{S_2^2},\\frac{1}{F_{\\alpha/2}(n_1-1,\\,n_2-1)},\\frac{S_1^2}{S_2^2}F_{\\alpha/2}(n_2-1,\\,n_1-1)\\right).\\\\&amp;\\text{本题所给}1-\\alpha=0.90,\\ \\alpha=0.10,\\ \\frac{\\alpha}{2}=0.05,\\,n_1=5,\\,n_2=7.\\\\&amp;\\text{查}F\\text{分布表得}\\quad F_{0.05}(6,\\,4)=6.16,\\ F_{0.05}(4,\\,6)=4.53,\\ \\frac{s_1^2}{s_2^2}=\\frac{8,\\,73^2}{32.19^2}=0.0376,\\\\&amp;\\text{于是}\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{\\sigma_2^2}\\text{的}0.90\\text{的置信区间为}\\left(0.073\\times\\frac{1}{4.53},\\,0.0736\\times6.16\\right),\\text{即}(0.016,\\,0.453).\\end{aligned}</div>"
